					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031#post-2897054</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031/wriggle-like-a-fucking-eel#post-2897054</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 23 Jun 2017 13:55:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>WrongJohnSilver</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2000367</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's definitely beyond the scope here, but yes, there is a very distinct difference between being mentally ill and being evil. D-7294 is remorseless. Relaxed. Enjoying himself and his time at the Foundation. Doing what comes naturally to him.</p> <p>And D-7294 is most assuredly a <em>villain</em>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
