					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031#post-2877509</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031/wriggle-like-a-fucking-eel#post-2877509</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 20 Jun 2017 17:53:48 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Probably a fault of bereaucatic ableism and misunderstanding. It's too easy for people (and, I guess, companies) to paint evil people as mentally ill and demonize people with mental illness. This is something far outside the scope of this canon I think, but it did my inform my writing here; I write people with mental illness differently than I write villains and antagonists.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
