					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031#post-2866892</guid>
				<title>Author Post - Can you do the Chickenswim Dance?</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2337031/wriggle-like-a-fucking-eel#post-2866892</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 18 Jun 2017 01:13:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Decibelles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2005044</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Wrote this for the Christmas Exchange for <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" >WrongJohnSilver</a></span> in 2016, figured I'd post it. I don't like the idea that D-7924 is painted in other OMG stuff as mentally ill; I just think he's evil and twisted, and I wanted to lay the base for that. He's just evil.</p> <p>Thanks to the following:</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" >WrongJohnSilver</a></span> for liking it and suggesting a couple of changes.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span> for giving critique even though he hated the tale due to taste stuff.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1324229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="Gaffney" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1324229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gaffney" >Gaffney</a></span> for critiquing even though I 100% forgot what he suggested. I'm sure I implemented them.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=361873&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="Photosynthetic" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=361873)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/photosynthetic" >Photosynthetic</a></span> for writing the news report for me &lt;3</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=304355&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="Silberescher" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=304355)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/silberescher" >Silberescher</a></span> for critique.</li> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1497748486" alt="Aiden Eldritch" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aiden-eldritch" >Aiden Eldritch</a></span> for formatting help.</li> </ul> <p>What I listened to while writing: Nothing, really, but <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2CTbycx2Pfo">Whitehouse's Wriggle Like a Fucking Eel</a> fits the mood. Warning for possible seizure-inducing and epilepsy-inducing visuals, as well as loud noises.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
